# Boat-launch + GPS variant for SkystarsF405v2
# For a boat drone that DOES carry a GPS. Chain-@includes gps.params (GPS on
# SERIAL5 + compass + EKF sources + Stab/AltHold/Loiter modes), which itself
# @includes defaults.parm -- then adds the boat gyro overrides on top.
#
# This is just boats.params + gps.params combined, since --default-parameters
# only takes one file. Boat (gyro) and GPS are otherwise independent variants.
#
# Build with (the path MUST be absolute):
#   ./waf configure --board SkystarsF405v2 \
#       --default-parameters "$PWD/libraries/AP_HAL_ChibiOS/hwdef/SkystarsF405v2/boat_gps.params"
#   ./waf copter
#
# Same gyro caveat as boats.params: do a one-time gyro cal on solid, level
# ground first so good INS_GYROFFS_* offsets are saved (INS_GYR_CAL=0 uses
# them). Compass + accel calibrate per drone; outdoors for GPS lock.

@include gps.params

# Boat gyro overrides (see boats.params for the why)
INS_GYR_CAL,0
ARMING_CHECK,0
